    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: LCR40.79 FAQ2 -> LCR40.80",
      "summary": "FAQ2 under LCR40.79 attributes the 0% inflow for firm shorts to LCR40.80, which only sets outflow rates; the inflow rate is in the LCR40.79 table.",
      "impact": "Position: Firm short covered by reverse repo of 100 Level 2B RMBS maturing in 10 days. Reading a: Following FAQ -> LCR40.80 -> no inflow rate stated; reading only 40.80 gives no inflow figure (undefined). Reading b: Table in LCR40.79 -> 0% inflow -> 0; without short cover 25 -> 25. Difference: 25 (or undefined)",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
